{
 "role": "baseline",
 "fix": "Use an h8 pin (ISO 2338, 2.986-3.000) instead of the m6 dowel (T16B-h8pin). The bush maker recommends a running shaft of f7 or h7, and m6 is a press-fit size. Buy 3 x 6 bushes (no 3 x 5 bush was found in the catalogue searched [A]; confirm with the supplier) and open the knuckle bore to 6. The worst case of the fix is exactly 0.000 clearance (3.000 pin in a 3.000 bore), so check a few pins and pressed bores.",
